type":"paragraph","text":"Qあみあみはスタバ好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.あみスタバめっちゃ飲む！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お決まりは抹茶フラペチーノ！他に美味しいのあるなら知りたいな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q高校生活最後の夏ですが、あみあみは何かやりたい事や目標はありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.うーんなんだろ、ダイエットかな？今年こそ成功させたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.あみあみは夏にやりたい事は何ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.花火かな？お祭りも行きたい！浴衣でね(^ ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑあみあみがオムライスを作ってくれました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて、ケチャップで何という文字を書いてくれますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.「だ  い  す  き」！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.俺のこと覚えてる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.覚えてるよーー（＾∇＾）！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qスタバで唱える呪文教えてけろっぴ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.えぇ？？なにそれー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"呪文なんてあるの？逆に教えてけろ。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.あみちゃんの、好きな、アイドルさんは、いますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.ぱすぽさん、ももクロさん、アイドリングさん、いっぱいいるでー可愛い子大好きやでー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.あみは海外のファンはどう思ってる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.ちよぉー